  "title": "Fat 4-polytopes",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "The fatness of a 4-polytope $P$ is defined to be $(f_1 + f_2)/(f_0 + f_3)$ where $f_i$ is the number of faces of $P$ of dimension $i$.\n\nQuestion Does there exist a fixed constant $c$ so that every convex 4-polytope has fatness at most $c$?",
